<h2>Dynamic Science Stories</h2>
<p>
<i>Dynamic Science Stories</i> was a companion to <i>Marvel Science Stories</i>.
There was only 2 issues of the magazine published in the US. Issue 1 wa s
also published in the UK around April of 1939, and is considered extremely rare.
